RSS-Gov

RSS-Gov's governance research design was inspired by the Rewards Sharing Simulation
Engine, written by Christina Ovezik at the University of Edinburgh Blockchain
Technology Lab, and by contributions to that project, including Cerkoryn's CIP-50 work.

Reference repository:
https://github.com/Blockchain-Technology-Lab/Rewards-Sharing-Simulation-Engine

RSS-Gov is maintained independently and shares no code with the reference simulator.
Chain data are read from the public Koios API and are not redistributed here.
